+  workspace-hash: e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855
+  output (5 lines):
+    | identity:true:[(this Collection)]
+    | equal:caught
+    | contains:caught
+    | map-equal:caught
+    | map-key:caught:0
+
+## Fogell
+  result:         success
+  workspace-hash: e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855
+  output (5 lines):
+    | identity:true:[(this Collection)]
